WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.450
<v Urban>A gun this size does not defend a wall. It changes the mind of the man approaching it.

00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:10.600
<v Loukas Notaras>It changes the mind of the treasurer first.

00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:12.450
<v Constantine>What would you require?

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:18.750
<v Urban>Bronze. Powder. Charcoal. Masons. Carpenters. Oxen.

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:21.550
<v Urban>A foundry that can breathe without collapsing.

00:00:22.150 --> 00:00:26.700
<v Urban>And pay enough that my men do not sell the design before the mold dries.
